    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "Step into the enchanting world of <strong>Mystical Mushrooms</strong>, where you play as <strong>Cyne</strong>, a brave and adventurous pink mushroom girl. Explore <strong>Bhokniva</strong>, a hidden and mystical realm now plagued by a mysterious disease that alters the behavior of its inhabitants.<br><br>As Cyne, your mission is to uncover the secrets behind this enigmatic disease and restore Bhokniva to its former glory. Gather resources from vibrant forests and eerie caves to survive and build a shelter, essential for protecting yourself from the dangerous creatures that lurk in the shadows at night.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045890/extras/88ecb8ecdd78fce143c3037982c58b79.avif?t=1744277901\" width=600 height=138 /></span><br><br><br>Throughout your journey, you will encounter a diverse cast of characters, both good and evil. Some will offer help and guidance, becoming valuable allies, while others may deceive and betray you. Your interactions and choices will have a significant impact on the unfolding story, shaping the destiny of Bhokniva.<br><br>Immerse yourself in a richly detailed world filled with enchanting visuals and a captivating narrative. Mystical Mushrooms combines exploration, resource management, and survival elements, creating a unique and rewarding gameplay experience. Uncover hidden treasures, forge alliances, and make critical decisions that will determine the fate of this magical land.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045890/extras/bd4094884268af939fadb6aef1e3f3dd.avif?t=1744277901\" width=600 height=138 /></span><br><br><br>The game is beautifully crafted with a blend of pixel art and rendered images, creating a visually stunning and immersive environment that brings Bhokniva to life.<br><br>Are you ready to embrace the adventure and become the hero Bhokniva desperately needs? Join Cyne in Mystical Mushrooms and let the epic journey begin!",
    "about_the_game": "Step into the enchanting world of <strong>Mystical Mushrooms</strong>, where you play as <strong>Cyne</strong>, a brave and adventurous pink mushroom girl. Explore <strong>Bhokniva</strong>, a hidden and mystical realm now plagued by a mysterious disease that alters the behavior of its inhabitants.<br><br>As Cyne, your mission is to uncover the secrets behind this enigmatic disease and restore Bhokniva to its former glory. Gather resources from vibrant forests and eerie caves to survive and build a shelter, essential for protecting yourself from the dangerous creatures that lurk in the shadows at night.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045890/extras/88ecb8ecdd78fce143c3037982c58b79.avif?t=1744277901\" width=600 height=138 /></span><br><br><br>Throughout your journey, you will encounter a diverse cast of characters, both good and evil. Some will offer help and guidance, becoming valuable allies, while others may deceive and betray you. Your interactions and choices will have a significant impact on the unfolding story, shaping the destiny of Bhokniva.<br><br>Immerse yourself in a richly detailed world filled with enchanting visuals and a captivating narrative. Mystical Mushrooms combines exploration, resource management, and survival elements, creating a unique and rewarding gameplay experience. Uncover hidden treasures, forge alliances, and make critical decisions that will determine the fate of this magical land.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045890/extras/bd4094884268af939fadb6aef1e3f3dd.avif?t=1744277901\" width=600 height=138 /></span><br><br><br>The game is beautifully crafted with a blend of pixel art and rendered images, creating a visually stunning and immersive environment that brings Bhokniva to life.<br><br>Are you ready to embrace the adventure and become the hero Bhokniva desperately needs? Join Cyne in Mystical Mushrooms and let the epic journey begin!",
